Scope of this repository
===============================================================================
This repository contains:
  * an independent compatibility fix authored by the project contributors:
    a one-line patch to the DKMS Makefile shipped by the vendor driver package
    (patches/), plus helper scripts and documentation (scripts/, README.md);
    these are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; and
  * a verbatim transcription of the OPEN-LICENSED kernel sources contained in
    the vendor package lisuangpu-dkms 262.2.0.56 (vendor-src/, see its
    README.md for provenance and SHA-256). Per the package copyright file and
    the per-file headers, those sources are licensed under GPLv2 /
    Dual MIT/GPLv2 and are redistributed here under GPLv2.

It does NOT contain, and does not redistribute, the CLOSED-SOURCE parts of the
Lisuan (砺算) GPU driver — in particular the precompiled binary blob
`objs/x86_64/lisuan_proprietary.o.hex` shipped in lisuangpu-dkms — nor any
user-mode libraries or `.deb` packages. Those remain the property of their
respective owners and must be obtained from the vendor / OEM by the end user
(see README.md).

